{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有。Y在S11—S13加入了几处X没有明确表达的心理推演，如“自己需要对方”“让对方安心”“即使听到以后不变仍然追问”，使人物心理略显过度解释，也减少了一点原本的克制和留白。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为边听边扫的普通观众，Y的重点加亮和短句分层更容易让我迅速抓住每段发生了什么，按音乐小节出现的感受提示也让我更容易把文字和听觉变化对应起来。X的完整叙述在人物动机和前后因果上更稳，读完更容易形成一条连贯的心理变化线；但它的感受词相对静态、抽象，细腻程度不如Y。综合实际观看体验，我选Y，主要优势是更容易在有限时间里同时获得故事重点和具体的音乐感受。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a49962dc-f64a-4b4a-ac16-d32bcfeb3440", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T002043759332Z", "elapsed_seconds": 101.719, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:22:25.500124+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "96cae659483184f287a6af2e35d09fe33eefb036a1b52ca920d455ccb5831948", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3f